height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628810/extras/d9d941c07f943644c4d9728d27a1ef5b.webm?t=1788188579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628810/extras/d9d941c07f943644c4d9728d27a1ef5b.mp4?t=1788188579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover clues scattered throughout the building to piece together how a normal school turned into a fortress, and how that fortress became a hunting ground.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628810/extras/03af99f68688a535a76f3671d57a82dd.poster.avif?t=1788188579\" width=854 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628810/extras/03af99f68688a535a76f3671d57a82dd.webm?t=1788188579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628810/extras/03af99f68688a535a76f3671d57a82dd.mp4?t=1788188579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your cat is your primary survival tool. Animals pick up on things humans miss, and watching your companion's reactions is often the only advance warning you get before stepping into unnatural danger.  <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628810/extras/eba474b1e0bf0ed343bb8c337bf5c24a.webp?t=1788188579\" width=854 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628810/extras/c1d199382a2e61c427f91a055fc1a536.poster.avif?t=1788188579\" width=700 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam